OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a frosty start for
OL,6,Fmany. Mostly dry with sunny spells
OL,7,Fthrough the day, but a few showers the
OL,8,Fin far northeast during the morning.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FMostly dry with clear spells
OL,11,Fat first and an early frost. Turning
OL,12,Fcloudier through the evening and
OL,13,Fovernight but staying mostly dry, with
OL,14,Fjust the odd shower from the east.
OL,15,
OL,16,CTuesday:FIt will be cloudy throughout
OL,17,Fthe day with outbreaks of rain and
OL,18,Fhill snow, turning heavy at times.
OL,19,FBreezy around the coast with fresh
OL,20,Feasterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
