OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FWednesday starts rather cloudy with
OL,7,Fsome rain, becoming increasingly dry
OL,8,Fwith bright spells developing.
OL,9,FThursday and Friday will be chilly
OL,10,Fwith bright spells and a few showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
